# Testing rules

- Unit-test pure helpers (URL parsing, organizer templates, hashing).
- Mock external processes in CI — no live YouTube calls.
- Rust: `cargo test` for database migrations and validators.
- Frontend: Vitest for lib/store helpers.
- New commands should include validation failure coverage when practical.
